  "notes": "Item 19 discloses Gross Sales only (no cost, profit, or EBITDA data per note 12). Two tables presented: Table 1 (annual) and Table 2 (monthly, derived by dividing annual by 12). Cohort is 676 of 698 US franchised studios open at least 12 months as of Feb 28, 2026, reporting period March 1, 2025 \u2013 February 28, 2026. Studios are split into performance thirds (Top, Middle, Bottom) plus a Total row. The 'thirds' cohorts are performance_anchored by gross sales ranking. Minimum value for Top third equals Maximum value for Middle third ($530,851) and similarly Middle/Bottom boundary is $355,990 \u2014 consistent with contiguous ranking tiers. Confidence docked slightly because the cohort_name for the Total rows could reasonably be labeled open_24_plus_mo given studios had to be open prior to March 1, 2025 (i.e., at least 12 months before Feb 28, 2026), but the FDD only states 'at least 12 months.'"
